<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Set Timezone - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This fixlet will set the timezone on the endpoint. A few popular timezones have been preset but if you need a custom timezone, use the list below. If the timezone needs to have Daylight Saving Time disabled, append the timezone name with _dstoff, i.e. "Pacific Standard Time_dstoff". A list of all valid timezones is below. Copy the name in the right column of the timezone that you want. Do not include any quotes, just the name in the right column.</P>
<P>
<TABLE style="WIDTH: 479pt; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=638>
<COLGROUP>
<COL style="WIDTH: 312pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 15213" width=416>
<COL style="WIDTH: 167pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 8118" width=222>
